e056","quote":"尋加督寧、益軍事。時劉聰入寇，京師危逼。簡遣督護王萬率師赴難，次於涅陽，為宛城賊王如所破，遂嬰城自守。及洛陽陷沒，簡又為賊嚴嶷所逼，乃遷于夏口。招納流亡，江、漢歸附。時華軼以江州作難，或勸簡討之。簡曰：「與彥夏舊友，為之惆悵。簡豈利人之機，以為功伐乎！」其篤厚如此。時樂府伶人避難，多奔沔漢，宴會之日，僚佐或勸奏之。簡曰：「社稷傾覆，不能匡救，有晉之罪人也，何作樂之有！」因流涕慷慨，坐者咸愧焉。年六十卒，追贈征南大將軍、儀同三司。子遐。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanjian:line056:m0217","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanjian:line056:m0158"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanjian","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-shanjian","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanjian:line056","quote":"尋加督寧、益軍事。時劉聰入寇，京師危逼。簡遣督護王萬率師赴難，次於涅陽，為宛城賊王如所破，遂嬰城自守。及洛陽陷沒，簡又為賊嚴嶷所逼，乃遷于夏口。招納流亡，江、漢歸附。時華軼以江州作難，或勸簡討之。簡曰：「與彥夏舊友，為之惆悵。簡豈利人之機，以為功伐乎！」其篤厚如此。時樂府伶人避難，多奔沔漢，宴會之日，僚佐或勸奏之。簡曰：「社稷傾覆，不能匡救，有晉之罪人也，何作樂之有！」因流涕慷慨，坐者咸愧焉。年六十卒，追贈征南大將軍、儀同三司。子遐。","source_term":"子遐"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-w043-shanxia-jian","interpretation_note":"直接父子見所引原句。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A"}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-w043-shanxia","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A","event_type":"death","source_term":"卒於官","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-shanxia","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059","quote":"遐字彥林，為余姚令。時江左初基，法禁寬弛，豪族多挾藏戶口，以為私附。遐繩以峻法，到縣八旬，出口萬餘。縣人虞喜以藏戶當棄市，遐欲繩喜。諸豪強莫不切齒於遐，言于執事，以喜有高節，不宜屈辱。又以遐輒造縣舍，遂陷其罪。遐與會稽內史何充箋：「乞留百日，窮翦捕逃，退而就罪，無恨也。」充申理，不能得。竟坐免官。後為東陽太守，為政嚴猛。康帝詔曰：「東陽頃來竟囚，每多入重。豈郡多罪人，將捶楚所求，莫能自固邪！」遐處之自若，郡境肅然。卒於官。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"依本來源登記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shanjian:line056:m0217","start":217,"end":218,"surface":"遐","kind":"person","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanjian:line056","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanjian"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"遐","kind":"person","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"彥林","kind":"person","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"遐","kind":"person","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059:m0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"遐","kind":"person","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059:m0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"遐","kind":"person","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059:m0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"遐","kind":"person","person_id":"82k_3oi_qf8_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia:line059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-shanxia"},{"id"